flowchart LR
  win([Window resized]) --> sc{horizontalSizeClass}
  sc -->|compact| stack[NavigationStack<br>today's iPhone app]
  sc -->|regular| w{width}
  w -->|under 1000pt| two[Sidebar + thread<br>sidebar overlays or hides]
  w -->|1000 to 1300pt| split[Sidebar + thread<br>column 680pt]:::hl
  w -->|over 1300pt| three[Sidebar + thread + inspector<br>column 720pt]
  split ==>|⌥⌘I on 11 inch| insp[Inspector open<br>sidebar folds away]
  insp -.->|inspector closed| split
  stack -.->|wider again| split
  two --- kb{Hardware keyboard?}
  split --- kb
  kb -->|yes| keys[Return sends · hints · ⌘K<br>GCKeyboard]
  kb -->|no| phone[iPhone composer behaviour]
